From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 03:59:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban show: sentence-case skip advice after a full
 stop; an expired quota wall re-offers the pool re-place

PR #1846 review nits (t_01a1d2f6ffb32e98, review 5885624814):
1. local_words joins the preceding sentence (the pool re-place, or the skip framing) and
   kanban_dispatch_skip.advice(skip) with '. ', and advice() starts lowercase, so `kanban show` read
   '... instead of waiting for a local slot. resolve that dispatcher skip reason ...' (and '... running). it starts
   on its own ...' without a pool). New skips.sentence_advice() capitalises it for that join; notices keep the
   lowercase clause after their NO_FIX prefix.
2. pool_replace_helps suppressed the pool re-place for any pinned_quota_wall skip from skips.latest, including one
   whose `until` had passed before a later tick replaced it. Suppression now needs until > now; a missing,
   unparseable or NaN until keeps suppressing (conservative). `now` is a keyword for tests (default time.time()).

Proof: 13 new test cases RED on origin/main (all failed), GREEN after; 4 older assertions on the kanban show text
move to sentence_advice. 27 importer/notice test files: 653 passed. scripts/check --base origin/main: 18 checks ok.
